<!--
  accounts tab icon for Cifra. One outline set at a single stroke weight, replacing
  bitmaps that only existed up to hdpi and were upscaled on modern screens.
  Literal colours, not resource references: build-time PNG generation cannot
  resolve those. The tab strip tints it for the selected and normal states.
-->
